      "message": "Hmm... not sure about this one, but does this return the Summary Task ID? Gemini thinks this will result in the wrong id being used and always returning 0 children:\n\nHere\u0027s how gemini verified, not sure how legit this is as I\u0027m not familiar with this code.\n\n```\n# Querying with Summary ID (ending in 0) returned by Buildbucket:\n$ prpc call chromium-swarm.appspot.com swarming.v2.Tasks.ListTasks \u003c\u003cEOF | jq \u0027.items | length\u0027\n{\"start\": \"${START_TIME}\", \"tags\": [\"parent_task_id:7ac52c7f07b9f110\"], \"state\": \"QUERY_ALL\"}\nEOF\n# Output: 0\n\n# Querying with Run ID (ending in 1):\n$ prpc call chromium-swarm.appspot.com swarming.v2.Tasks.ListTasks \u003c\u003cEOF | jq \u0027.items | length\u0027\n{\"start\": \"${START_TIME}\", \"tags\": [\"parent_task_id:7ac52c7f07b9f111\"], \"state\": \"QUERY_ALL\"}\nEOF\n# Output: 1\n```",
